        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: \"To the End of the Earth\", \"Beautiful\"\n- People: Jessica Mauboy\n- Places: Westfield Knox, Knox City Shopping Centre, Wantirna South, Melbourne, Victoria, Australia\n- Topics: song releases, shopping centres\n\nFacts:\n- Jessica Mauboy recorded the song \"To the End of the Earth.\"\n- \"To the End of the Earth\" was digitally released on 17 July 2013 as the lead single from Jessica Mauboy's third studio album \"Beautiful.\"\n- Westfield Knox, formerly known as Knox City Shopping Centre, is a super-regional shopping centre, outdoor entertainment, and professional services complex in Wantirna South, an outer eastern suburb of Melbourne in Victoria, Australia.",
